<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-AMERICA AND ATLETICO DRAW 2-2 IN COPA CENTENARIO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AMERICA AND ATLETICO DRAW 2-2 IN COPA CENTENARIO.</headline>
<dateline>BELO HORIZONTE, Brazil 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>America-Belo</p>
<p>Horizonte (Brazil) and Atletico Mineiro (Brazil) drew 2-2</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a Copa Centenario group A match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>America - Tupazinho, Celso</p>
<p>Atletico Mineiro - Valdir, Lincoln</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p>			    P  W  D  L  F  A Pts</p>
<p> Atletico Mineiro     2  0  2  0  4  4  2</p>
<p> America		  2  0  2  0  3  3  2</p>
<p> Milan (Italy)	  2  0  2  0  2  2  2</p>
<p> Corinthians (Brazil) 2  0  2  0  1  1  2</p>
<p>The competition is being played to celebrate the 100th</p>
<p>anniversary of the founding of Belo Horizonte.</p>
</text>
